{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "创造力与专注力的关系", "content": "有创造力的孩子更能够专注在某件事情上，创作时很难不专注，会自然而然地非常专注。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["专注力"], "tags": ["创造力", "专注力", "关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-32cb5553fe04", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:zz-c-19", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "均适用于有创造力的孩子在创作时的专注表现；无特定年龄。", "reason": "候选直接对应旧原子中'有创造力的孩子在创作时自然专注'的内容。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:zz-r-10", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "当孩子有想象空间、可探索任务时，创作过程自然带动专注，与旧原子第一句一致。", "reason": "候选陈述有创造力的孩子在创作时很难不专注，自然非常专注，内容等价。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "儿童天生具有创造力", "content": "每一个小孩子都很有创造力，但有时会被家长扑灭，或者家长不知道如何延伸、发展和引导出来。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我认知"], "tags": ["创造力", "儿童", "家长影响"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-32cb5553fe04", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:zz-r-10", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "当讨论创造力是否儿童本有时，与旧原子'创造力是孩子本有的能力'一致。", "reason": "候选说明每个孩子都很有创造力，但需要正确延伸和引导，覆盖旧原子本有能力和延伸两个重点。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "15岁青少年通过故事创作提升学习专注力", "content": "一个15岁青少年与父母关系糟糕，成绩不好，因为不喜欢枯燥乏味的东西，一遇到就无法专注学习，上课趴着，老师也讨厌他。父母接受parenting训练后，鼓励孩子发挥想象力，给孩子一个挑战：把当天老师讲的知识吸收后，自己创造成为一个故事，可以是历史故事或游戏故事，但必须基于知识延展。孩子照做后，对学习非常专注认真听讲，因为脑子里不停编写故事，要抓住每个知识点来完成故事，最终从学渣变成学霸。", "steps": ["父母接受parenting训练", "鼓励孩子发挥想象力", "给孩子挑战：将当天知识吸收后创造故事", "孩子执行：基于知识延展故事", "结果：孩子专注听讲，抓住知识点，成绩提升"], "conditions": ["孩子有想象力", "父母愿意改变教养方式"], "limits": [], "modules": ["专注力"], "tags": ["案例", "青少年", "故事创作", "学习专注力", "parenting训练"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-32cb5553fe04", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005", "b00006", "b00007", "b00008", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r001", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "案例中父母接受parenting训练是改善孩子学习问题的前提步骤", "reason": "记录a003提到父母接受parenting训练后鼓励孩子发挥想象力，而r001明确说明父母接受parenting训练是前提步骤。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r001", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u003", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u003", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r003", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u003", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r004", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u003", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"t