{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "让孩子带领玩耍以激发想象力", "content": "和孩子一起玩时，让孩子来带你玩，而不是你带着他玩。例如问孩子去哪里吃饭、吃什么、怎么去，让孩子决定玩什么。玩沙时不要指导孩子，不要批评他堆得不像城堡，让他自由想象。这样孩子完全靠自己的想象，想象力就出来了。", "steps": ["和孩子一起玩", "让孩子决定玩什么、怎么玩", "家长不指导、不批评", "让孩子自由发挥想象"], "conditions": ["孩子愿意参与"], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["玩耍", "想象力", "家长角色", "引导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-32cb5553fe04", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011", "b00012", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r005", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "让孩子带领玩耍的第一步是让孩子决定玩耍内容", "reason": "a004描述让孩子带领玩耍，r005具体说明让孩子决定玩什么。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r006", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "让孩子带领玩耍还包括家长不指导不批评", "reason": "a004提到家长不指导不批评，r006具体说明。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r005", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u004", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r006", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u004", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "不直接回答孩子问题，引导孩子自己寻找答案", "content": "当孩子问问题时，不管是什么问题，不要着急给答案，要和孩子一起寻找答案。可以反问孩子“你觉得呢？”，通过提问帮助孩子观察细节，自己得出答案。例如孩子问“为什么汽车有四个轮子？”或“外婆是什么样的人？”，可以引导孩子看照片观察。", "steps": ["孩子提出问题", "家长不直接回答", "反问孩子“你觉得呢？”", "引导孩子观察细节", "让孩子自己得出答案"], "conditions": ["孩子提出问题"], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["提问", "引导", "寻找答案", "观察"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-32cb5553fe04", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r007", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "不直接回答孩子问题的方法之一是反问“你觉得呢？”", "reason": "a005提到反问，r007具体说明。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r008", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "不直接回答孩子问题还包括通过提问帮助孩子观察细节", "reason": "a005提到通过提问帮助观察细节，r008具体说明。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r007", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u005", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:r008", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u005", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:n12-c-20", "kind": "complements", "condition": "孩子提出任何问题时；旧原子条件包含孩子提问。", "reason": "给出反问引导（你觉得呢？）和观察细节帮助孩子自己得出答案，补充旧原子用问题引导。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-32cb5553fe04-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
